  "features": [],
  "description_text": "Stylish Protective Cover with 3D Heart Accents Add a touch of elegance and playfulness to your phone with the Silver Love Heart Phone Case. Featuring raised metallic-effect heart designs, this case blends fashion and protection in one. Its slim fit provides a comfortable grip while keeping your phone safe from scratches, drops, and dust. ✨ Features: • Unique 3D silver heart accents for a trendy look • Durable and protective against everyday bumps • Slim, lightweight, and comfortable to hold • Available in Pink, Black, and Cream White • Compatible with multiple iPhone models Perfect for anyone who loves chic, girly, and fashion-forward accessories, this case is both protective and eye-catching – a must-have for your phone.",
  "description_html": "<div>Stylish Protective Cover with 3D Heart Accents</div>\n<div>Add a touch of elegance and playfulness to your phone with the Silver Love Heart Phone Case. Featuring raised metallic-effect heart designs, this case blends fashion and protection in one. Its slim fit provides a comfortable grip while keeping your phone safe from scratches, drops, and dust.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>✨ Features:</div>\n<div><span> • Unique 3D silver heart accents for a trendy look</span></div>\n<div><span> • Durable and protective against everyday bumps</span></div>\n<div><span> • Slim, lightweight, and comfortable to hold</span></div>\n<div><span> • Available in Pink, Black, and Cream White</span></div>\n<div><span> • Compatible with multiple iPhone models</span></div>\n<div></div>\n<div>Perfect for anyone who loves chic, girly, and fashion-forward accessories, this case is both protective and eye-catching – a must-have for your phone.</div>"
}